---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import portrait from "../assets/picture.jpg";
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1 class="sr-only" data-i18n="aboutTitle">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <Image
      class="portrait"
      src={portrait}
      alt="Michele Tadiello in the Dolomites, Italy"
      widths={[480, 960]}
      sizes="20rem"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <p data-i18n="aboutLead">
      My work sits at the intersection of clinical informatics, healthcare AI, and digital health
      innovation. I have multi-year experience building AI infrastructure, clinical data systems,
      and strategic partnerships across academic medical centers, startups, and healthcare
      organizations.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n="aboutAdvisory">
      I advise leaders on AI/ML implementation, healthcare operations, venture strategy, and the
      practical adoption of emerging technologies in clinical settings. My work also focuses on
      healthcare affordability, financial toxicity, and data-driven decision-making for patients
      and health systems.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n="aboutInfrastructure">
      I have developed financial models and analytics tools designed to reduce financial toxicity
      while supporting better operational and clinical decisions. I also built an AI agent for
      clinical content retrieval to help nurses access trusted information more efficiently.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n="aboutPublications">
      My research and writing have appeared in peer-reviewed journals including JAMA Network Open
      and JAMIA, as well as in newspaper articles on the role of artificial intelligence in
      healthcare.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n="aboutEducation">
      I hold a Master's degree of Management in Clinical Informatics from Duke University School
      of Medicine and a Bachelor of Nursing from the University of Verona School of Medicine.
    </p>

    <h2 data-i18n="stackTitle">Stack</h2>
    <p data-i18n-html="stackInformatics">
      <strong>Informatics &amp; AI/ML:</strong> NLP/LLM systems, predictive modeling, RAG architecture,
      clinical analytics, EHR data (Epic Clarity), FHIR/HL7, OMOP CDM.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n-html="stackData">
      <strong>Data:</strong> SQL, MySQL, BigQuery, Dataform, Dataplex, Looker Studio.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n-html="stackEngineering">
      <strong>Engineering:</strong> Python, PyTorch, TensorFlow, Hugging Face, LangChain, Docker, GitHub.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n-html="stackCloud">
      <strong>Cloud/Product:</strong> AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, Jira, Figma.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ul class="links" aria-label="Contact">
    <li><a href="mailto:mictadiello@gmail.com" data-i18n="navEmail">email</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michele-tadiello" rel="noopener">linkedin</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/mictadiello" rel="noopener">github</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=it&user=yyzWSssAAAAJ" rel="noopener">scholar</a></li>
  </ul>
</Base>
